{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Glossary.GlossaryCategoricalTransport","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Glossary.GlossaryCategoricalTransport","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalTransport.transport_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalTransport.transport_eq","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-transport.lean#L35-L35","doc":"**The transport equation** `D_∇ψ = 0`.\n\nWas `transport_eq : Prop`, so the instance chose what the equation\nsaid and `True` discharged it. It is now the equation the docstring\nnames. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalTransport.psi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalTransport.psi","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-transport.lean#L29-L29","doc":"The section `ψ ∈ τ(J¹(A))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalTransport.D","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalTransport.D","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-transport.lean#L27-L27","doc":"The q-deformed covariant derivative `D_∇`, acting on sections.\n\nWas `q_connection : Prop`, which is a typing error rather than a thin\nstatement: a connection is DATA, and a field typed with the universe\n`Prop` holds a proposition. There was no proposition to hold. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalTransport.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalTransport.mk","kind":"ctor","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-transport.lean#L21-L21","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalTransport","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalTransport","kind":"structure","line":15,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-transport.lean#L15-L35","doc":"The categorical transport equation D_∇ψ = 0.\n\nIn the QOU framework this is the q-deformed covariant derivative\ncondition on sections ψ ∈ τ(J¹(A)). The q-correction comes from\nthe categorical q-exterior derivative d_q acting on the jet bundle. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:rem:glossary-categorical-transport","label":"rem:glossary-categorical-transport","md":"quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-transport.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}